proxilens (2.1.0~beta10.13) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Package the Duo PAM module, sudo/Polkit policy broker, Duo credential
    synchronizer/import helper, integration scripts, GNOME extension payload,
    and prebuilt wake agent in the Debian package.
  * Keep privileged integrations opt-in and prevent package removal while PAM
    still references the ProxiLens module.
  * Resolve integration scripts from /usr/libexec/proxilens/scripts.
  * Depend on Ubuntu's split polkitd and pkexec binary packages instead of
    the unavailable policykit-1 package name.
  * Install the PAM module under the architecture-specific multiarch library
    directory on amd64 and arm64.
  * Update README and AppStream metadata to describe the actual packaged
    integration features rather than the historical diagnostic-only build.

 -- ProxiLens Maintainers <maintainers@example.invalid>  Fri, 27 Nov 2026 20:00:00 +0100

